 : 4 routines beauté (11 produits, valeur 239€) pour 16€ sans engagement\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Méga offre Glowria : 4 routines gourmandes avec 11 produits (Weleda, Hipanema, Nideco) d'une valeur de 239€ pour seulement 16€. Sans engagement.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/glowria-mega-offre-4-routines-16-euros-2026.png\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"aggregateRating\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"AggregateRating\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ratingValue\\\\\\\":4.5,\\\\\\\"bestRating\\\\\\\":5,\\\\\\\"ratingCount\\\\\\\":12},\\\\\\\"review\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Review\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reviewRating\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Rating\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ratingValue\\\\\\\":4.5,\\\\\\\"bestRating\\\\\\\":5},\\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BonsPlansMania\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"reviewBody\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Méga offre Glowria : 4 routines gourmandes avec 11 produits (Weleda, Hipanema, Nideco) d'une valeur de 239€ pour seulement 16€. Sans engagement.\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"offers\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Offer\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/glowria-mega-offre-4-routines-11-produits-16-euros-2026\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"price\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"16.00\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"priceCurrency\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"EUR\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"availability\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\\\\\"}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Accueil\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2